  "description": "Integration-test kit for GM.Messaging services: MessagingContainers starts PostgreSQL and RabbitMQ (with management) via Testcontainers and hands out fresh databases and ready-to-use Messaging settings; MessagingAssertions checks what landed in the outbox and inbox (ShouldHaveOutboxEventAsync, ShouldHaveNoPendingOutboxAsync, ShouldHaveHandledAsync, ShouldHaveDeadLetteredAsync) and Eventually waits for asynchronous work. Reads payloads through GM.Messaging's IntegrationEventRegistry and payload protection, like the relay does. Test-only (DevelopmentDependency).",
